{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-05-05 08:00:00', 'title': 'COLLINS AEROSPACE UPGRADES U.S. NAVY C-130 FLEET WITH LONG-LASTING WHEELS AND CARBON BRAKES', 'text': "TROY, OHIO, MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COLLINS AEROSPACE CONTINUES TO HELP C-130 OPERATORS REDUCE MAINTENANCE TIME AND COST WITH ITS LONG-LASTING WHEELS AND CARBON BRAKES. THE BUSINESS, A UNIT OF RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX), TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED ITS FIRST UPGRADE OF THE U.S. NAVY'S FLEET OF C-130T AND KC-130T AIRCRAFT WITH NEW WHEELS AND BRAKES."}